    <string name="guide_section">How it works</string>
    <string name="guide_daily_title">Daily missions</string>
    <string name="guide_daily">Fixed and drawn::1 fixed mission plus several drawn ones that change every day.\nStreak minimum::On Normal 75% of the missions is enough. 60% on Easy, 100% on Hard.\nPerfect day::Do them all for bonus XP and a new echo.\nDoesn\'t fit today?::Swap one drawn mission a day for free, or create your own in the Forge. If something only fits some days, make it weekly.</string>
    <string name="guide_streak_title">Streak and rest</string>
    <string name="guide_streak">Grows every day::+1 for each day you reach the minimum.\nSecond chance::Lost it? A perfect day right after brings it back (once a week).\nRest days::Call one before noon and the day counts neither way. 2 a week on Easy, 1 on Normal.\nExtra protection::The Shield of Constancy and some echoes save your streak for you.</string>
    <string name="guide_penalty_title">Penalty</string>
    <string name="guide_penalty">Proportional loss::You lose XP and gold for what was left undone. Almost there costs almost nothing.\n24 hours::Below 50% a penalty starts with extra missions. Do them and it ends early.\nApp blocking::If you want, your distracting apps stay blocked while it lasts.</string>
    <string name="guide_side_title">Side quests</string>
    <string name="guide_side">Free-form::Write any task, no targets or rules.\n5 with rewards::The first 5 finished each day give XP and gold and hurt the boss.\nAfter that::They keep working as a to-do list.\nNo cheating::Unticking or deleting takes the reward back.</string>
    <string name="guide_boss_title">Weekly boss</string>
    <string name="guide_boss">All XP is damage::Every mission you do takes its health.\nBoss challenge::A special mission that rips off 35% at once.\nLoot::Beat it for XP, gold, a chest and its echo.\nIf not…::On Sunday night it ends — and another one comes.</string>
    <string name="guide_portal_title">Portals</string>
    <string name="guide_portal">They show up on their own::Between 8 AM and 10 PM, up to 2 a day.\nDouble rewards::A bigger mission with twice the XP and gold.\nNew ally::Clearing it may bring you an echo.\nOn the clock::There\'s always enough time, but the portal closes when it runs out.</string>
    <string name="guide_shadows_title">Echoes</string>
    <string name="guide_shadows">Where to find them::Perfect days, bosses, portals, achievements, streak milestones and the shop.\nSquad::Up to 3 in the field, each with a passive: more XP, more gold, more damage, protection.\nGrowth::Duplicate copies and gold level an echo up, up to your own level.</string>
    <string name="guide_focus_title">Focus and Pomodoro</string>
    <string name="guide_focus">Link a mission::Minutes count for it. A free session only counts in your stats.\nThe right mode::Each mission is timer or Pomodoro, and only that mode counts.\nReal breaks::In Pomodoro only focus minutes count, and apps are free on breaks.\nNo limit::Counts until you stop.\nNo quitting::Stopping early loses the minutes; finishing counts +25% and bonus gold.</string>
    <string name="guide_shop_title">Shop</string>
    <string name="guide_shop">Items::Swap missions, protect your streak, XP and gold elixirs, chests.\nEchoes for sale::3 a week, refreshed every Monday.\nInventory::What you buy is kept until you use it.</string>
    <string name="auto_backups">Automatic copies</string>
    <string name="auto_backups_info">The app keeps one copy a day for the last 7 days. With Android backup on, they also go to your Google account.</string>
